%%{ init: { 'theme': 'dark' } }%%
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Intake: Content + Context

    Intake --> Plan: Initialize state

    Plan --> Execute_PII: Determine checks<br/>based on frameworks + source
    note right of Plan
        Checks selected:
        - PII (always)
        - Security (user input)
        - Compliance (if frameworks)
        - Safety (always)
        - Brand (text/email/chat)
    end note

    Execute_PII --> Execute_Policy: PII findings

    state Execute_PII {
        [*] --> GDPR_Check
        [*] --> HIPAA_Check
        [*] --> SOC2_Check
        GDPR_Check --> [*]
        HIPAA_Check --> [*]
        SOC2_Check --> [*]
    }

    Execute_Policy --> Evaluate: Policy findings

    state Execute_Policy {
        [*] --> Injection_Check
        [*] --> Safety_Check
        [*] --> Brand_Check
        Injection_Check --> [*]
        Safety_Check --> [*]
        Brand_Check --> [*]
    }

    Evaluate --> Remediate: confidence ≥ 0.70
    Evaluate --> Escalate: confidence < 0.70<br/>or 3+ cross-category findings

    state decision <<choice>>
    Evaluate --> decision
    decision --> Remediate: Auto-handle
    decision --> Escalate: Human review needed

    Remediate --> Report
    Escalate --> Report

    state Remediate {
        [*] --> Determine_Action
        Determine_Action --> Redact: PII violations
        Determine_Action --> Rewrite: Tone/brand
        Determine_Action --> Block: Critical security
        Redact --> [*]
        Rewrite --> [*]
        Block --> [*]
    }

    state Escalate {
        [*] --> Create_Ticket
        Create_Ticket --> Submit_Queue: Priority sorted
        Submit_Queue --> [*]
    }

    Report --> [*]: Audit trail + metrics

    note right of Report
        Generates:
        - Audit trail entry
        - Violation summary
        - Framework impact
        - Performance metrics
    end note
